# ============================================================
# HOW TO SET UP YOUR API KEY
# ============================================================
# This project supports two LLM providers -- you only need ONE.
# Fill in whichever token your trainer gave you and leave the other blank.
#
# STEP 1: Copy this file and rename it to .env
# STEP 2: Fill in ONE of the keys below (ask your trainer which one)
# STEP 3: Save the file and run the app
# ============================================================

# Option 1 (Recommended): GitHub Copilot token
# GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here
# GITHUB_MODEL=openai/gpt-4.1-mini

# Option 2: Claude / Anthropic API key
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
